+                    << " workgroups, exceeding the hardware limit of "
+                    << maxMaskPopcount << " set mask bits; splitting it into "
+                    << "subgroups of " << numMulticastCTAs
+                    << " workgroups. A cluster layout sharing data "
+                    << "among at most " << numMulticastCTAs
